# The node detail showing the four sensor groups beyond device metrics and environment.
#
# The groups only appear for a node that actually reported them, which is the whole reason they
# are separate groups: a plain handheld shows none, a solar repeater shows power, an indoor
# sensor shows air quality, a base station running meshtasticd shows a filesystem. This walks
# the ones the demo mesh has.
#
# Row 0 of the Nodes list is the Map, so a node's row is its index in the demo roster plus
# one - Echo Repeater is seeds[5] and row 6, Golf Cabin is seeds[7] and row 8. Getting that
# wrong renders a node with no sensor group at all, which is this scene showing nothing and
# still producing a picture, so count the rows against devtools/ui_capture/main.c rather than
# against the roster.

scene demo
tab nodes

# Echo Repeater: a solar node with a two-channel current monitor.
key down 6
key a
key down 24
hold 1200
key b

# Golf Cabin: an indoor particulate and CO2 sensor. Relative to where B left the cursor, which
# is Echo's own row rather than the top of the list.
key down 2
key a
key down 21
hold 1200
key b
